{
  "title": "Albumin\u2013CRP coupling does not establish incremental platelet prediction across two NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "Adding a log-albumin \u00d7 log-CRP interaction to flexible conventional predictors did not establish improved log-platelet prediction in exploratory NHANES2007\u20132008 to2009\u20132010 transfer (4,827 source,5,188 target adults). Weighted MSE difference was 0.00003345 (0.068% worse); jointPSU-bootstrap95% interval [-0.00018871,0.00043501].",
